msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Completado"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__mercas_firm_negotiation
msgid ""
"The supplier is paid in full for what was received of this lot, regardless "
"of what was sold, instead of settling by sale. Takes its initial value from "
"the source purchase line. Only an Accounting Manager can change it, and only"
" while the lot has no firm invoicing recorded."
msgstr ""
"Se paga al proveedor la totalidad de lo recibido de este lote, con "
"independencia de lo vendido, en vez de liquidar por venta. Toma su valor "
"inicial de la línea de compra de origen. Solo lo puede cambiar un Gestor de "
"contabilidad, y solo mientras el lote no tenga facturación en firme "
"registrada."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__received_kg
msgid ""
"Kg physically received from the supplier (validated incoming transfers)."
msgstr ""
"Kg recibidos físicamente del proveedor (albaranes de entrada validados)."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__net_invoiced_kg
msgid "Kg of validated supplier invoices minus kg of validated credit notes."
msgstr "Kg de facturas de proveedor validadas menos kg de abonos validados."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__net_invoiced_amount
msgid "Net Invoiced Amount"
msgstr "Importe facturado (neto)"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__net_invoiced_amount
msgid ""
"Amount of posted supplier invoices minus posted credit notes of this lot."
msgstr ""
"Importe de facturas de proveedor posteadas menos abonos posteados de este "
"lote."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__invoiced
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mercas_base.view_stock_lot_invoice_wizard_form
msgid "Invoiced"
msgstr "Facturado"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__invoiced
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the lot is considered fully invoiced to the supplier. "
"Updated automatically, but can be forced manually; once edited by hand it "
"stops being recalculated on its own."
msgstr ""
"Indica si el lote se considera completamente facturado al proveedor. Se "
"actualiza automáticamente, pero puede forzarse manualmente; una vez editado "
"a mano deja de recalcularse solo."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__invoiced_locked
msgid "Invoiced Manually Locked"
msgstr "Facturado fijado manualmente"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__invoiceable
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mercas_base.view_stock_lot_search_mercas
msgid "Invoiceable"
msgstr "Facturable"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_help:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__invoiceable
msgid ""
"Candidate to invoice to the supplier: under the full-payment regime, it has "
"received kg pending invoicing; under the sale-settlement regime, there is a "
"pending amount on what has been sold (and scrapped) so far, whether it is "
"completed (final settlement) or still has stock available (advance)."
msgstr ""
"Candidato a facturar al proveedor: en régimen de pago total, tiene kg "
"recibidos pendientes de facturar; en régimen de liquidación por venta, hay "
"importe pendiente sobre lo vendido (y desechado) hasta ahora, ya esté "
"completado (liquidación final) o con stock todavía disponible (anticipo)."

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__supplier_amount
msgid "Supplier Amount"
msgstr "Importe proveedor"

#. module: mercas_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mercas_base.field_stock_lot__supplier_price_kg
msgid "Supplier Price/Kg"
msgstr "Precio/kg proveedor"

